  "body": "## Change and scope\n\nAnswers the partitioned independent-walks open question on the [#2715](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2715) / [#2761](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2761) multi-connector lineage in the five-source common-B mutable-source alphabet of [#1898](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/1898): can two restored walks with distinct slot lists, independent dirt, and dual even-parity readout undercut tariff `436` at total `Q=7`?\n\n| Dual schedule | Covering pairs | Exact R | Tariff floor (X\u22650) | Undercuts 436? |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| Same-walk even-subset (#2686) | \u2014 | \u226582 | \u2265442 at X=6 | no |\n| Partition `(2,5)` | **416640** | **112** | **\u2265490** | **no** |\n| Partition `(3,4)` | **833280** | **112** | **\u2265490** | **no** |\n\nEvery covering partitioned dual has exact `R=112`. Length-1 components are not restored. Abstract tariff already `\u2265490 > 436` at `X=0`.\n\n**Scoped obstruction / priced alphabet; no new kappa.** Leave-alone through [#2764](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2764) / [#2761](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2761) / [#2715](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2715) was not reopened.\n\n## Result\n\nPackage: `research/independent-walks-7q-obstruction/`.\nTip: `1f2a413f9e27ce9609924f7ab196548c4cbe43d8`.\n\nExact: partitioned dual min R **112** (tariff floor **490**); no undercut of 436.\n\n## Validation\n\n```sh\npython3.12 -I -B research/independent-walks-7q-obstruction/verify.py\npython3.12 -I -O -B research/independent-walks-7q-obstruction/verify.py\npython3.12 -I -B research/independent-walks-7q-obstruction/independent.py\npython3.12 -I -B research/independent-walks-7q-obstruction/test_package.py\npython3.12 -B scripts/research_package.py --package research/independent-walks-7q-obstruction\n```\n\nExpected:\n\n```text\nPASS_INDEPENDENT_WALKS_7Q_OBSTRUCTION partition_min_R=112 ... tariff_floor=490 ... answers_independent_walks_partitioned no_new_kappa\nPASS_INDEPENDENT_PARTITIONED_WALKS_7Q covering_25=416640 covering_34=833280 ... tariff_floor=490 ... no_new_kappa\nPASS_INDEPENDENT_WALKS_7Q_PACKAGE_TESTS groups=6\nPASS_REGISTERED_RESEARCH_PACKAGE research/independent-walks-7q-obstruction outcome=completed\n```\n\nDefault verify is read-only. Admission uses `need()`; `-O` also passes.\n\n## Overlap and credit\n\nClosest prior: [#2761](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2761) (same-walk multi-connector), [#2686](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2686), [#2715](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2715). Freestanding partitioned dual-walk fixture; no competing open PR at refresh.\n\nCredit the mutable-source / #2761 / #2715 / #2686 / PR1898 lineage. Prepared by Wentao Li ([VictorLiwentao](https://github.com/VictorLiwentao), [@Is__Victor](https://x.com/Is__Victor)) with substantial AI assistance, under Apache-2.0.",
